---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/astro/PageHeader.astro';
import { WHATSAPP_DISPLAY } from '../../../../shared/contact.js';
import '../styles/ReturnRefundPolicy.css';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Return & Refund Policy | Climb Crux Pakistan"
  description="Read the Climb Crux Return & Refund Policy for climbing equipment purchased through the official Climb Crux website."
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="Legal" title="Return & Refund Policy">
    <p>Last Updated: September 18, 2026</p>
  </PageHeader>

  <section class="section policy-section">
    <div class="wrap policy-wrap">
      <section class="policy-block">
        <h2>1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
          This Return &amp; Refund Policy applies to all climbing equipment purchased through the
          official Climb Crux website.
        </p>
        <p>
          Climb Crux accepts eligible returns within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong>, subject to
          the conditions outlined below.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-block">
        <h2>2. Eligible Returns</h2>
        <p>
          A product may be returned within 7 days of receiving the order in the following situations:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>The product was damaged when received.</li>
          <li>The product is defective.</li>
          <li>The wrong product was received.</li>
          <li>
            The customer changed their mind and wishes to return the product, provided that the
            product meets the return conditions in this policy.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          For returns where there is <strong>no product defect, damage, or fulfillment error</strong>,
          the customer is responsible for the <strong>return shipping and associated logistics costs</strong>.
          Climb Crux will not be responsible for these costs.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-block">
        <h2>3. Product Condition</h2>
        <p>
          For a return to be accepted, the product must be in a condition suitable for return and
          inspection.
        </p>
        <p>
          Climbing equipment that has been <strong>used while climbing</strong> is not eligible for
          return.
        </p>
        <p>
          Products that have been used, damaged through use, altered, or show significant signs of use
          may not be accepted for return.
        </p>
        <p>
          Where applicable, products should be returned with their original packaging, accessories,
          tags, and other items supplied with the order.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-block">
        <h2>4. Non-Returnable Products</h2>
        <p>Climbing equipment is not eligible for return if it has been used while climbing.</p>
        <p>
          This includes equipment that has been exposed to climbing use, damaged through use, altered,
          or otherwise shows signs that it has been used for climbing.
        </p>
        <p>
          This restriction is intended to protect the safety and integrity of climbing equipment.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-block">
        <h2>5. Return Time Limit</h2>
        <p>
          Return requests must be submitted within <strong>7 days of receiving the order</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>Requests submitted after this period may not be accepted.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-block">
        <h2>6. Return Shipping and Logistics</h2>
        <p>For returns due to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>A product being damaged when received</li>
          <li>A product being defective</li>
          <li>The wrong product being received</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Climb Crux will provide instructions regarding the return process and will determine the
          appropriate handling of return shipping costs.
        </p>
        <p>
          For <strong>change-of-mind or other non-defective returns</strong>, the customer is
          responsible for all return shipping and associated logistics costs.
        </p>
        <p>
          The customer should not send a product back before contacting Climb Crux and receiving
          return instructions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-block">
        <h2>7. Refund Process</h2>
        <p>
          To request a return or refund, contact Climb Crux through our official WhatsApp number and
          provide:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your order number</li>
          <li>A description of the reason for the return</li>
          <li>Clear photographs or other relevant proof, where applicable</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          For damaged, defective, or incorrect products, photographs or other evidence may be required
          to verify the issue.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our team will review the request and determine whether the product qualifies for a return
          under this policy.
        </p>
        <p>
          Once the return is approved, Climb Crux will provide instructions for returning the product.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-block">
        <h2>8. Refund Timeline</h2>
        <p>
          Once the returned product has been received at the Climb Crux office and the return has been
          reviewed and approved, the refund will be processed within <strong>7 days</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          The refund processing period begins from the date the returned product is received and
          approved by Climb Crux.
        </p>
        <p>
          Return shipping and logistics costs paid by the customer for an eligible change-of-mind
          return are not refundable.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-block">
        <h2>9. How to Request a Return or Refund</h2>
        <p>Please contact Climb Crux through our official WhatsApp number:</p>
        <p class="policy-whatsapp">WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/923350044403">{WHATSAPP_DISPLAY}</a></p>
        <p>
          Please provide your order number, explain the reason for the return, and provide clear
          photographs or other relevant information where applicable.
        </p>
        <p>Our team will review the request and guide you through the next steps.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-block">
        <h2>10. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>Climb Crux Pakistan</p>
        <p class="policy-whatsapp">Official WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/923350044403">{WHATSAPP_DISPLAY}</a></p>
        <p>For questions regarding returns or refunds, please contact us through our official WhatsApp number.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
